From d8f01f1da54d212491db0a2dd53299f4554bf56a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shaowenlong <shaowenlong@xfusion.com>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 03:22:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fix int32->float32 upcast in FP8 einsum and enable SM12x
 deep_gemm path

- deepgemm.cmake: update build config for SM12x support
- fp8_utils.py: fix int32 to float32 conversion in quantization
- sparse_attn_indexer.py: remove unused code path
- fp8_einsum.py: enable SM12x FP8 einsum kernel with proper upcast
- cuda.py: add SM12x GPU capability recognition
- deep_gemm.py: refactor to use new deep_gemm SM120 kernels
- indexer.py: fix data type handling in MLA attention indexer
---
 cmake/external_projects/deepgemm.cmake        |  7 +-
 .../layers/quantization/utils/fp8_utils.py    | 11 ++++
 .../layers/sparse_attn_indexer.py             |  6 ---
 .../deepseek_v4/nvidia/ops/fp8_einsum.py      | 20 ++++++--
 vllm/platforms/cuda.py                        |  6 ++-
 vllm/utils/deep_gemm.py                       | 51 +++----------------
 vllm/v1/attention/backends/mla/indexer.py     |  6 +--
 7 files changed, 44 insertions(+), 63 deletions(-)

